  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guidelines for Afghan Small and Medium-sized Enterprises (SMEs) to employ women and support their economic empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment seeks to address the obstacles and enhance the comprehension of the barriers that Afghan Small and Medium-sized Enterprises (SMEs) face in hiring women and supporting their financial stability.It also aims to create practical guidelines for SMEs, partner organizations, and financing institutions to help women with safe and productive employment opportunities that enable them to achieve economic empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
